Qwen, PrismML and IncoAI models
  Language/model inputs are not redistributed. Bonsai2 is PrismML's ternary
  fine-tune of Qwen3.8-27B. DFlash2 checkpoint is incoai/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2;
  HIP MTP is from Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B. Halo6000 uses a custom ternary preparation
  of Qwen3.6-35B-A3B. Follow each source model/checkpoint's distribution terms.
  Source DFlash semantics reference https://github.com/z-lab/dflash.

